    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where cheese is not just a food but a sacred artifact, one brave mouse decides to fight the rat mafia that has stolen all the supplies! Meet Mishaka, our hero, ready to defend his rights and get back his lost goodies! Mishaka is not ironclad, he only has 1 life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264710/extras/00ad13267308df80e97130914c1a86cb.webp?t=1732900425\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Battles</strong>: Mishaka will fight rat bosses, using agility to defeat enemies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264710/extras/b1fb142e084c9a1a3d415f32dc6485d2.poster.avif?t=1732900425\" width=616 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264710/extras/b1fb142e084c9a1a3d415f32dc6485d2.webm?t=1732900425\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264710/extras/b1fb142e084c9a1a3d415f32dc6485d2.mp4?t=1732900425\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264710/extras/0f0e2790423c742d1bc89f3c7829f55c.webp?t=1732900425\" width=616 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels</strong>: Explore a variety of locations from dark basements to sewers, collecting power-ups along the way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop play